      "title": "Example guide · 14.4s",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Spark-H3 + minimax_h3_comfyui 8-step LoRA\n\n- LoRA: `minimax_h3_fl2v_turbo_8step_v1.0_comfyui_bf16.safetensors` at strength 1.0.\n- Scheduler: `simple`, 8 steps; Spark `steps=8`, `warmup_ratio=0.25` (first 2 evaluations dense), `topk_ratio=0.2`, `dense_layers=1`.\n- Sampler: `KSamplerSelect`.\n- Original three-shot VDN prompt 8; text-to-video with synchronized audio: 345 frames (14.4 s) at 24 fps, 1344×768, seed 42. First/last frame inputs are empty.\n- Load the LoRA before Spark; Spark output feeds both BasicGuider and BasicScheduler.\n- Model files are searched through the local ComfyUI extra model paths.\n"
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "# Spark-H3 + minimax_h3_comfyui 8-step LoRA\n\n- LoRA: `minimax_h3_fl2v_turbo_8step_v1.0_comfyui_bf16.safetensors` at strength 1.0.\n- Scheduler: `simple`, 8 steps; Spark `steps=8`, `warmup_ratio=0.25` (first 2 evaluations dense), `topk_ratio=0.2`, `dense_layers=1`.\n- Sampler: `KSamplerSelect`.\n- Original three-shot VDN prompt 8; text-to-video with synchronized audio: 345 frames (14.4 s) at 24 fps, 1344×768, seed 42. First/last frame inputs are empty.\n- Load the LoRA before Spark; Spark output feeds both BasicGuider and BasicScheduler.\n- Model files are searched through the local ComfyUI extra model paths.\n"
